Usage Data: We may also collect non-personal data like usage statistics and device characteristics to improve our service and user experience. This includes information on how the app is accessed and used, including device type, operating system, app version, and time spent on the app.
Analytics: We use analytics tools to track and report app usage patterns in an aggregated, anonymous form for statistical analysis.
Data Sharing: 
We do not share, sell, rent, or trade your personal information with third parties for their promotional purposes. If we do share data for any reason (like for service improvement), it will be in an anonymized, aggregated form.
Your login information is stored securely and is only used for account management within our app.

